The following implements the core changes related to this [design doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JaU_to9xikifQktm5-16scFy2TfW0cFD7KGQtIbJ_Qw/edit).

- Defines the template variables definitions for List and Text variables, along with the schema changes
- Adds support for Text variables
- Sets up plugin structure for variables
- Removes all existing Template variable prototype code

Examples

**TextVariable**
```json
{
    "kind" : "TextVariable",
    "name": "foo",
    "options": {
        "value": "bar"
    }
}
```

**ListVariable**
```json
{
    "kind" : "ListVariable",
    "name": "foo",
    "options": {
        "kind": "MyCustomListVariable",
        "options": {
            "value": [1,2]
        }
    }
}
```

